{"id":"vod_zy360_67618","vodId":"67618","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"男子高中生的日常","name_cn":"男子高中生的日常","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241104-1/78b278a7364708b496c3ffe7d01db4b3.jpg"},"summary":"《男子高中生的日常》以真田北男校为舞台，围绕着主角忠邦（入野自由配音），以及他的死党秀则（杉田智和配音）和吉竹（铃村健一配音）的日常高中生活而展开。忠邦主要担任吐槽的角色，长相中性的他常常被秀则和吉竹联合欺负。登场人物还有同校学生会的元治、唐泽、副会长和会长等人，这是一群基本上没有女朋友的男校学生，在鲜有女生参与的情况下，展开了插科打诨的日常高中生活。这是一部搞笑向的作品，内容短小，笑点十足。动画以每集一个小故事的节奏，采用“男子高中生与XX”的标题形式，将男子高中生的爆笑日常故事呈现给观众。本作根据山内泰延的同名漫画《男子高中生的日常》改编而成。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-04 21:25:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/dkKxVprt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/W9snmIwt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/HbGwtbGH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/gH8ry5u6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/YAU5D3dt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/fXKEnKOP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/fbPRgM3s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/mRuePM96/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/96RNpmDd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/OI47UJH4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/UUgJHUga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241104/ELiroXp6/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:37.747Z"}